yle=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">:</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">:</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> actions/deploy-pages@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>In your repository settings, set Pages source to <strong>GitHub Actions</strong>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepos\" class=\"pp-heading\">Monorepos<a class=\"pp-heading-anchor\" href=\"#monorepos\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>In a monorepo, run commands from the site package directory:</p>\n<div class=\"pp-code-block\" data-language=\"bash\"><div class=\"pp-code-lang\" aria-hidden=\"true\">bash</div><button class=\"pp-code-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\" data-copied-label=\"Copied\" data-copy-icon=\"&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M8 7a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h6a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6a3 3 0 0 1-3 3h-1v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H7a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-6a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h1V7Zm2 1h3a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v3h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1Zm-3 2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h6a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-6a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7Z&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-check-icon=\"&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M9.55 16.2 5.8 12.45a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 1.42l4.46 4.46a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0L20.03 8.56a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42L9.55 16.2Z&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\"><span class=\"pp-code-copy-ic